{
 "attachments": [
  {
   "content": {
    "$schema": "http://adaptivecards.io/schemas/adaptive-card.json",
    "actions": [
     {
      "data": {
       "mode": "high_risk_confirm",
       "primusclaw": "github_mode"
      },
      "style": "positive",
      "title": "高风险再问我",
      "type": "Action.Execute",
      "verb": "primusclaw.github_mode"
     },
     {
      "data": {
       "mode": "fully_auto",
       "primusclaw": "github_mode"
      },
      "title": "全自动合入",
      "type": "Action.Execute",
      "verb": "primusclaw.github_mode"
     },
     {
      "title": "添加 PrimusClaw Assistant",
      "type": "Action.OpenUrl",
      "url": "https://teams.microsoft.com/l/app/x"
     }
    ],
    "body": [
     {
      "columns": [
       {
        "items": [
         {
          "color": "Accent",
          "size": "Large",
          "text": "┃",
          "type": "TextBlock",
          "weight": "Bolder"
         }
        ],
        "spacing": "None",
        "type": "Column",
        "width": "auto"
       },
       {
        "items": [
         {
          "size": "Medium",
          "text": "⚙️ 选择代审合入的确认方式",
          "type": "TextBlock",
          "weight": "Bolder",
          "wrap": true
         },
         {
          "isSubtle": true,
          "size": "Small",
          "spacing": "None",
          "text": "当前：高风险再问我",
          "type": "TextBlock",
          "wrap": true
         }
        ],
        "spacing": "Small",
        "type": "Column",
        "verticalContentAlignment": "Center",
        "width": "stretch"
       }
      ],
      "type": "ColumnSet"
     },
     {
      "items": [
       {
        "text": "高风险人工再确认一次（默认）（当前）",
        "type": "TextBlock",
        "weight": "Bolder",
        "wrap": true
       },
       {
        "isSubtle": true,
        "spacing": "Small",
        "text": "审完没有问题、检查全部通过时直接批准并合入；模型判断为高风险的变更（安全、凭据、CI/发布、权限、数据迁移等）以及仓库要求确认的变更，先发卡片请你本人确认。",
        "type": "TextBlock",
        "wrap": true
       }
      ],
      "spacing": "Medium",
      "type": "Container"
     },
     {
      "items": [
       {
        "text": "全自动合入，无需人工确认",
        "type": "TextBlock",
        "weight": "Bolder",
        "wrap": true
       },
       {
        "isSubtle": true,
        "spacing": "Small",
        "text": "审完没有问题、检查全部通过时直接批准并合入，不再请你确认；只有仓库自己要求确认的变更（.github/claw-review.yml 的 confirm_merge: always 等）仍会先问你。",
        "type": "TextBlock",
        "wrap": true
       }
      ],
      "spacing": "Medium",
      "type": "Container"
     },
     {
      "isSubtle": true,
      "size": "Small",
      "text": "这个设置对你自己让 PrimusClaw Assistant 审 PR、以及同事请你代审都生效。是否允许同事以你的名义请我审并合入，是另一个开关：`/github auto-merge on|off`。",
      "type": "TextBlock",
      "wrap": true
     },
     {
      "id": "review-mode-en-toggle",
      "items": [
       {
        "color": "Accent",
        "size": "Small",
        "text": "English ▾",
        "type": "TextBlock",
        "weight": "Bolder",
        "wrap": true
       }
      ],
      "selectAction": {
       "targetElements": [
        "review-mode-en"
       ],
       "title": "English",
       "type": "Action.ToggleVisibility"
      },
      "spacing": "Small",
      "type": "Container"
     },
     {
      "id": "review-mode-en",
      "isVisible": false,
      "items": [
       {
        "size": "Small",
        "text": "**A person confirms high-risk changes (default)** (current): Approved and merged when nothing needs fixing and every check passes; a change the reviewing model judges high risk (security, credentials, CI/release, permissions, data migrations, ...) or one the repository asks to confirm waits for your own click on a card.",
        "type": "TextBlock",
        "wrap": true
       },
       {
        "size": "Small",
        "text": "**Fully automatic merge, nobody is asked to confirm**: Approved and merged when nothing needs fixing and every check passes, without asking you; only a change the repository itself requires a person for (confirm_merge: always in its review config, and the like) still waits for your click.",
        "type": "TextBlock",
        "wrap": true
       },
       {
        "size": "Small",
        "text": "This applies when you ask PrimusClaw Assistant to review a pull request and when a colleague asks PrimusClaw Assistant to review one as you. Whether colleagues may ask at all is the other switch, `/github auto-merge on|off`.",
        "type": "TextBlock",
        "wrap": true
       }
      ],
      "spacing": "Small",
      "type": "Container"
     },
     {
      "isSubtle": true,
      "size": "Small",
      "text": "按钮点不了时，直接回复「确认全自动」或「确认高风险再问我」即可。",
      "type": "TextBlock",
      "wrap": true
     }
    ],
    "type": "AdaptiveCard",
    "version": "1.5"
   },
   "contentType": "application/vnd.microsoft.card.adaptive"
  }
 ],
 "type": "message"
}
